WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.119
Concord turns meetings into requirements.

2
00:00:06.032 --> 00:00:10.212
Upload a transcript, or invite Concord's bot to join the call.

3
00:00:11.012 --> 00:00:13.903
Concord pulls out use cases, terms,

4
00:00:13.903 --> 00:00:17.778
competency questions, open questions and decisions.

5
00:00:18.579 --> 00:00:21.284
Lines that fed a use case are tagged with it,

6
00:00:21.284 --> 00:00:23.960
so you can check the speaker's own words.
